<title>LATVIA: Latvian Feb mo/mo CPI 0.4 pct, yr/yr 9.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Latvian Feb mo/mo CPI 0.4 pct, yr/yr 9.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inflation in Latvia was 0.4 percent in February on a monthly basis, leading to a year-on-year increase in prices of 9.8 percent, the statistics office said on Friday.</p>
</text>
